se-mixer's UCNET protocol layer (src/ucnet/) is a Rust port of parts of
presonus-studiolive-api (https://github.com/featherbear/presonus-studiolive-api),
revision 3e02b29a4a5b28695b6e1fad057ec4b4508f915a (v1.9.1), used under the MIT License:

  - util/messageProtocol.ts, util/DataClient.ts        -> src/ucnet/packet.rs
  - packetParser/*.ts, util/subscriptionUtil.ts,
    util/KeepAliveHelper.ts, util/jsonPacketUtil.ts     -> src/ucnet/msg.rs, src/ucnet/client.rs
  - util/zlib/ubjson.ts                                  -> src/ucnet/ubjson.rs
  - util/zlib/zlibNodeParser.ts, util/zlib/zlibUtil.ts   -> src/ucnet/tree.rs
  - MeterServer.ts                                       -> src/ucnet/meters.rs
  - Discovery.ts                                         -> src/ucnet/discovery.rs
  - util/valueUtil.ts (logVolumeToLinear)                -> src/map.rs (db_to_fader)

The discovery announcement layout used in tests follows
https://github.com/featherbear/presonus-studiolive-console-advertisement (same author).

